---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { company } from '../../data/company';
// PLACEHOLDER: plain-language draft, to be reviewed by EZTek's lawyer before launch
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How EZTek Solutions collects and uses information from this website and the client portal.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" crumbs={[['Privacy', '/privacy/']]} />
  <section class="band"><div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="note"><span class="draft">Draft</span><span>Plain-language draft for legal review.</span></p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>What you type into our forms: name, contact details, building address and the details of your request. We also record how you found the site (for example a search ad or a referral link) so we know which channels work.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>To answer your request, schedule surveys and service, send proposals and invoices, and run the client portal. We may call, text or email you about your request.</p>
    <h2>Who sees it</h2>
    <p>EZTek staff and the service providers that run our email, forms, portal and payments, only to provide those services. We do not sell your information.</p>
    <h2>Website assistant</h2>
    <p>The chat assistant on this site is an AI service. What you type or say to it is sent to Anthropic, the company that runs the AI, to produce replies. Voice input is turned into text by your browser. If you ask the assistant to pass a request to us, it saves your name, contact details and a summary of what you need, like our other forms. Please do not share passwords, door codes or payment details in the chat.</p>
    <h2>Video and access data</h2>
    <p>Footage and access logs from systems we install belong to the building owner. We access them only to provide service you asked for.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Ask us to see, correct or delete your information at <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a> or {company.phoneDisplay}.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
